        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"In\" means the element \"indium\" and \"117In\" is the isotope \"indium-117\" with a half-life of 3.05e-02 days."@en;
