<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/F68AND4N/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::F68AND4N";
        dc:date                "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::F68AND4N";
        pav:authoredOn         "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/F68AND4N/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_131Sb_in_air/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_131Sb_in_air>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"integral_wrt_X_of_Y\" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase \"wrt\" means \"with respect to\". \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Sb\" means the element \"antimony\" and \"131Sb\" is the isotope \"antimony-131\" with a half-life of 1.60e-02 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::F68AND4N";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_131Sb_in_air"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P06/current/BSM3/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV7N66/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::CFV7N66";
        dc:date                "2007-11-21 17:19:40.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::CFV7N66";
        pav:authoredOn         "2007-11-21 17:19:40.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFV7N66/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/tendency_of_atmosphere_mass_content_of_ammonia_due_to_wet_deposition/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/tendency_of_atmosphere_mass_content_of_ammonia_due_to_wet_deposition>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Wet deposition\" means deposition by precipitation."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CFV7N66";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "tendency_of_atmosphere_mass_content_of_ammonia_due_to_wet_deposition"@en;
