        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "\"Mass concentration\" means mass per unit volume and is used in the construction \"mass_concentration_of_X_in_Y\", where X is a material constituent of Y. A chemical species or biological group denoted by X may be described by a single 